{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>前《英雄聯盟》（League of Legends，LOL）世界冠軍Toyz（劉偉健）因販賣大麻煙彈案服刑895天後獲核准假釋，外傳已於27日出獄，但因在台居留逾期且身負犯罪紀錄，恐將被移送收容所強制遣返香港；與此同時，今年初與他登記結婚的妻子篠崎泫28日在社群大方曬出多張比堅尼辣照，罕見解放火辣身材，吸引大批網友朝聖。</p><p>篠崎泫28日在社群平台分享一系列水邊美照，身穿淡紫色比堅尼搭配天藍色運動褲與同色系棒球帽，頭髮綁成包包頭，對鏡頭展現甜美微笑，罕見大方露出深邃事業線，其中一張由上往下的俯拍「邪惡視角」更是辣翻眾人，她也甜喊：</p><blockquote><p>我抓住了夏天的尾巴。</p></blockquote><figure><img alt=\"Toyz（劉偉健）因販毒入獄如今爆已出獄或遭遣返香港，同時愛妻篠崎泫曬出比堅尼照，引破萬人按讚。（IG@hsyan0625）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261029/1192422411530670080192680.jpeg/9d6z4jIk7p8ze8bEv9W4rnyXIbs8SMMbOg6rmToOq5k\"/><figcaption>Toyz（劉偉健）因販毒入獄如今爆已出獄或遭遣返香港，同時愛妻篠崎泫曬出比堅尼照，引破萬人按讚。（IG@hsyan0625）</figcaption></figure><p>更多Toyz（劉偉健）辣妻篠崎泫曬比堅尼照片：</p><figure><img alt=\"Toyz（劉偉健）愛妻篠崎泫曬比堅尼辣照，引破萬人按讚。（IG@hsyan0625）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261029/1192422745556652032473692.jpeg/d24e0gJ91FXnWwwx5-xolkLywP7jaabhSZaFMEmWhTA\"/><figcaption>Toyz（劉偉健）愛妻篠崎泫曬比堅尼辣照，引破萬人按讚。（IG@hsyan0625）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Toyz（劉偉健）愛妻篠崎泫曬比堅尼辣照，引破萬人按讚。（IG@hsyan0625）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261029/1192422748035616768013759.jpeg/lj6K6dkbqOfFsIg0czJYyG8URxnTrrDgCUGKPAlBijw\"/><figcaption>Toyz（劉偉健）愛妻篠崎泫曬比堅尼辣照，引破萬人按讚。（IG@hsyan0625）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Toyz（劉偉健）愛妻篠崎泫曬比堅尼辣照，引破萬人按讚。（IG@hsyan0625）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261029/1192422750338420736680357.jpeg/7-2KYDJV1H29ybuZ1HwItoK_litK9drs-9GhrPvRoaw\"/><figcaption>Toyz（劉偉健）愛妻篠崎泫曬比堅尼辣照，引破萬人按讚。（IG@hsyan0625）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Toyz（劉偉健）愛妻篠崎泫曬比堅尼辣照，引破萬人按讚。（IG@hsyan0625）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261029/1192422752477646848371425.jpeg/ZtqijGbt4h-Igf_ISEdcI3dSfpVmXhrkat5EJGreRCQ\"/><figcaption>Toyz（劉偉健）愛妻篠崎泫曬比堅尼辣照，引破萬人按讚。（IG@hsyan0625）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Toyz（劉偉健）愛妻篠崎泫曬比堅尼辣照，引破萬人按讚。（IG@hsyan0625）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261029/1192422754805616640067342.jpeg/gWVI2jUxSDyq6YdZOC1VusNH9RhiiZ_AHMe-0RzHvtE\"/><figcaption>Toyz（劉偉健）愛妻篠崎泫曬比堅尼辣照，引破萬人按讚。（IG@hsyan0625）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Toyz劉偉健爆已於27日出獄，或遭強制遣返香港。（Instagram@toyzlol）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260128/1093114005725253632956324.jpeg/RRD0DpmgnRTtIs4Y3GUGvgKejEVDaEhbNFRX8DRUV_A\"/><figcaption>Toyz劉偉健爆已於27日出獄，或遭強制遣返香港。（Instagram@toyzlol）</figcaption></figure><p>邪惡視角吸萬人按讚朝聖</p><p>貼文曝光後短短一小時內即吸引破萬人按讚，網友紛紛湧入留言區大讚：</p><p>「好美身材好好，難得的大尺度」</p><p>「這實在是太火辣了，這個視角很會抓」</p><p>「肉肉都長在對的地方」</p><p>「這辣度是麻辣鍋大辣等級了吧？」</p><p>不過篠崎泫並未對Toyz出獄一事做出任何回應。</p><p>相較妻子的熱烈話題，Toyz獲假釋後恐面臨強制遣返程序。知情人士指出，Toyz服刑期間在台居留權已逾期，依《香港澳門關係條例》及《入出國及移民法》相關規定，移民署專勤隊預計在其離監時直接接人並移送收容所，隨後執行強制驅逐出境遣返香港，雖兩人已登記結婚，但因他在台有犯罪紀錄，移民署仍得不予許可依親居留。</p><figure><img alt=\"延伸閱讀：Toyz劉偉健爆獄中與篠崎泫登記結婚　申請假釋最快今年11月可出獄（Instagram@toyzlol）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260128/1093115007761125376068591.jpeg/FqGFOgGRgy8l18QX6p3WhC2H5xEo-8tA_tDZ9v7Q2fY\"/><figcaption>延伸閱讀：Toyz劉偉健爆獄中與篠崎泫登記結婚　申請假釋最快今年11月可出獄（Instagram@toyzlol）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"香港電競直播網紅Toyz（劉偉健）因販毒案遭判坐監4年2月，2024年5月入獄服刑。 （Instagram@toyzlol）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260128/1093114009462640640741239.jpeg/2NaYERgCi7ETIrGmmZZtyRFjSwOa0VFqdm31YHZt9WA\"/><figcaption>香港電競直播網紅Toyz（劉偉健）因販毒案遭判坐監4年2月，2024年5月入獄服刑。 （Instagram@toyzlol）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"1月28日被週刊爆料，Toyz（劉偉健）已經在獄中與女友篠崎泫登記結婚，喜訊曝光。（Instagram@toyzlol）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260128/1093115016670351360908415.jpeg/dbhIFtxPCCNF5ri3B2DDco8ho98i2xDmSDxy3Ug8ct0\"/><figcaption>1月28日被週刊爆料，Toyz（劉偉健）已經在獄中與女友篠崎泫登記結婚，喜訊曝光。（Instagram@toyzlol）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"篠崎泫（Instagram@toyzlol）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260128/1093115012698083328806352.jpeg/PxQzXygE7R_YK78nCo9BaalKYtSQlgyb9JRmvPSUZrw\"/><figcaption>篠崎泫（Instagram@toyzlol）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"篠崎泫（Instagram@toyzlol）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260128/1093115015801999360563720.jpeg/SdwluKhYpXZFKGKzmH6GEChmBeLD8xVSLBNeWSwTXlk\"/><figcaption>篠崎泫（Instagram@toyzlol）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"篠崎泫（Instagram@toyzlol）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260128/1093115018134163456421569.jpeg/1yQA0r57qsI5tJFs0i5OSlZfxg1z-2lNBi0powYtKaM\"/><figcaption>篠崎泫（Instagram@toyzlol）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"篠崎泫（Instagram@toyzlol）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260128/1093115007291363328564093.jpeg/cKw7zHoC_5nK6o7545McJuDPDlMvxYD3SozWZ0qM1mc\"/><figcaption>篠崎泫（Instagram@toyzlol）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"篠崎泫（Instagram@toyzlol）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260128/1093115013255925760926107.jpeg/z45-BGxciXZ3yX4124E4q2WQJQ8CD8l5P_Agiz_wIIs\"/><figcaption>篠崎泫（Instagram@toyzlol）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"篠崎泫（Instagram@toyzlol）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260128/1093115009799688192538907.jpeg/U8RnEo1WHCjXzAyc6zaHAUsi3oEFj2sARWHsN0Vh7Dc\"/><figcaption>篠崎泫（Instagram@toyzlol）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"篠崎泫（Instagram@toyzlol）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260128/1093115008499322880867403.jpeg/1ACTGRMK4pdxr8pTSeBGuG17c-euliapjpBfoY6QX6E\"/><figcaption>篠崎泫（Instagram@toyzlol）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"篠崎泫（Instagram@toyzlol）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260128/1093115011951497216310974.jpeg/AjoLy_7cOWUAVJPiF-_5pi-Xhpl8y5HIWnbt21p27ds\"/><figcaption>篠崎泫（Instagram@toyzlol）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"篠崎泫（Instagram@toyzlol）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260128/1093115014157832192782461.jpeg/CdEN5iLWe_PplFOTrzGo-56gnO3RdjbMJnoTiSZ6E4k\"/><figcaption>篠崎泫（Instagram@toyzlol）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"篠崎泫（Instagram@toyzlol）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260128/1093115010265255936046378.jpeg/o3nT8lP65VMtB5_Mxga3VSJ4CFBfWdupATxvkQE8b5E\"/><figcaption>篠崎泫（Instagram@toyzlol）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Toyz劉偉健（Instagram@toyzlol）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260128/1093114004546523136736194.jpeg/tMN0y0Ugw_EQ2kUcNAmdLB1mq8SfbcWvZuiNdmbojXY\"/><figcaption>Toyz劉偉健（Instagram@toyzlol）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Toyz劉偉健（IG@toyzlol）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260128/1093215063147286528573412.jpeg/nlNaOwquiuSypMu3VXyOfthQtd7YxjDSXwemJV8HpiU\"/><figcaption>Toyz劉偉健（IG@toyzlol）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Toyz劉偉健（Instagram@toyzlol）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260128/1093114010645434368430581.jpeg/D6ie1tSiwYbgMzi4sews3LwOmC6EPI4HGTRZTBk0WUw\"/><figcaption>Toyz劉偉健（Instagram@toyzlol）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Toyz劉偉健（Instagram@toyzlol）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260128/1093114005725253632956324.jpeg/RRD0DpmgnRTtIs4Y3GUGvgKejEVDaEhbNFRX8DRUV_A\"/><figcaption>Toyz劉偉健（Instagram@toyzlol）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Toyz劉偉健（Instagram@toyzlol）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260128/1093114003040768000130852.jpeg/dQTuDae7aEFduEloYVVD9deFLO6z9-LEXUFApV1BQKU\"/><figcaption>Toyz劉偉健（Instagram@toyzlol）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Toyz劉偉健（Instagram@toyzlol）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260128/1093113600416944128318204.jpeg/95Ow5eQpahzRmQQoiDx-tE_2mPZLM7MrBQZATwUGQE8\"/><figcaption>Toyz劉偉健（Instagram@toyzlol）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Toyz劉偉健（Instagram@toyzlol）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260128/1093114009533812736328697.jpeg/cW8r_-HmEYNa1Hx-BCx7Hgez4wq9MdrY1f3pxNX96cQ\"/><figcaption>Toyz劉偉健（Instagram@toyzlol）</figcaption></figure><p>快訊／家家發聲了！遭傳愛喝酒被前東家放生　證實：虛心接受</p><p>【本文獲「TVBS新聞網」授權轉載。】</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T10:01:24.185802+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1552,"images":27,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T09:45:31+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T10:18:37.197438+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T09:58:42.312541+00:00","content_hash":"9f6424972df3ddc6733b3449dd65d6ef4a0af1d25bbaffba2945fa83ac2bda8c","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}